OL,3,AAntidepressant escitalopram more
OL,4,Aeffective at preventing relapse,
OL,5,Aanalysis finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne drug comes out top in a large
OL,8,Fanalysis of how effective
OL,9,Fantidepressants are at keeping patients
OL,10,Ffree of symptoms of depression.
OL,12,FEscitalopram performed best at
OL,13,Fpreventing patients from relapsing in a
OL,14,Fstudy involving nearly 10,000 people
OL,15,Fprescribed different medications for up
OL,16,Fto a year.
OL,18,FTwo other pills - agomelatine and
OL,19,Fduloxetine - came next, while prozac
OL,20,F(also known as fluoxetine) ranked just
OL,21,Fbelow them.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
