OL,3,AAntidepressant escitalopram more
OL,4,Aeffective at preventing relapse,
OL,5,Aanalysis finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FExperts stress the findings don't mean
OL,8,Fthat everyone with severe depression
OL,9,Fshould switch to escitalopram, or that
OL,10,Fother antidepressants aren't any good,
OL,11,Fbecause all the drugs can work and each
OL,12,Fhas its pros and cons.
